# --------------------- chf sto options ---------------------

block options
name save_flows
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
longname keyword to save NPF flows
description keyword to indicate that cell-by-cell flow terms will be written to the file specified with ``BUDGET SAVE FILE'' in Output Control.
mf6internal ipakcb

block options
name export_array_ascii
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
mf6internal export_ascii
longname export array variables to layered ascii files.
description keyword that specifies input grid arrays, which already support the layered keyword, should be written to layered ascii output files.

# --------------------- chf sto griddata ---------------------

# none

# --------------------- chf sto period ---------------------

block period
name iper
type integer
block_variable true
in_record true
tagged false
shape
valid
reader urword
optional false
longname stress period number
description REPLACE iper {}

block period
name stress_period_data
type recarray storage
shape 1
reader urword
tagged false
optional true
longname
description
mf6internal spd

block period
name storage
type string
shape
valid steady-state transient
reader urword
optional false
longname storage type
description string to designate storage type for stress period IPER. Designated storage conditions will apply until a new storage type is specified in a subsequent BEGIN PERIOD block. Valid storage types are STEADY-STATE and TRANSIENT.
